msgctxt "252"
msgid "Well, that's a helicopter mom if I've ever seen one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid "She didn't mean what she said, Koji. Don't let it get to you, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid "I won't! Especially 'cause I made a new friend out of it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid "Heh, that's one way to look at it. You're a good kid, Koji."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid "Isn't your flight soon, Uncle Kaz?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid "Oh yeah, I almost forgot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid ""
"Just let me know when you're gonna leave, okay? I'll get the others to come "
"say goodbye."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid "Or... are you leaving now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid "Yeah, it's time to go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid "Okay! Just a second, I'll grab everyone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "420"
msgid "Thanks, Haruka."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "444"
msgid "Not quite yet. Still have some things to do around town."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "456"
msgid "Oh, okay. Want me to come with you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "468"
msgid "Not this time. Sorry, Haruka."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "480"
msgid "It's okay! Just come let me know when you're about to leave!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid "Of course I do. Can't exactly go exploring without you, can I?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "504"
msgid "Hehe, yay! Let's go!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "564"
msgid "Hey, Uncle Kaz! Let's play some baseball!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "576"
msgid "(I guess I do have a little time before I have to go.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "588"
msgid "All right, but just a bit, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "600"
msgid "Yeah! I'm pumped!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "624"
msgid "Hey, guys!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "648"
msgid "Uncle Kaz is gonna play with us!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "660"
msgid "We'll meet you down at the beach, okay? Don't make us wait!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "672"
msgid "Baseball boys... Baseball girls..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "696"
msgid "Move out!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "768"
